# Hybrid Autonomous + Bluetooth Robot

## Project Description
This robot operates in two modes:
1. Manual mode via Bluetooth
2. Autonomous mode using ultrasonic sensor

It demonstrates real embedded system design with mode switching and safety override logic.

---

## Features
- Dual-mode control system
- Bluetooth override capability
- Obstacle detection safety system
- Real-time decision making

---

## Components Used
- Arduino Uno
- HC-05 Bluetooth Module
- HC-SR04 Ultrasonic Sensor
- L298N Motor Driver
- DC Motors + chassis

---

## Key Concepts
- State-based system design
- Sensor fusion (manual + auto logic)
- Real-time embedded control
- Safety override systems

---

## Applications
- Delivery robots
- Industrial automation bots
- Semi-autonomous vehicles
- Smart robotics systems

